Data notice

The MIT licence above covers the source code in this repository only.

The underlying sales data comes from the Kaggle competition "Store Sales - Time
Series Forecasting" (Alexis Cook, DanB, inversion, Ryan Holbrook, 2021), with
data provided by Corporacion Favorita. The data belongs to its owners and is
subject to the competition's rules on Kaggle. It is NOT included in this
repository and is NOT covered by this licence. To reproduce the results,
download it yourself from Kaggle after accepting the competition rules.

Published model outputs and aggregates in outputs/, docs/data/ and excel/ are
derived from that data and are shared for portfolio and educational purposes
with citation.

Third-party code: docs/assets/vendor/plotly-cartesian-2.35.2.min.js is
distributed under its own licence (docs/assets/vendor/PLOTLY_LICENSE.txt).
